  unitName: Queen Lidith
  unitId: 30103
  unitNumber: 128
  description: A princess of the ruined Vriksha Duchy, and one of the country's most
    prominent swordswomen. She took to the battlefield when the gods invaded her
    country. With the Earth Sword Vriklius in hand she engaged in battle. However,
    due to her inexperience, she became isolated on the battlefield. Many sacrificed
    themselves to save her, but their efforts came to a tragic end.
  summonDesc: Sir Summoner...<br>Please let me go with you...<br>I will do all I
    can...
  fusionDesc: I need to get stronger...<br>I can't afford to repeat<br>the same mistake...<br>
  evoDesc: I've changed, but I musn't<br>be overconfident!<br>Was that too forward?
